{"__lastUpdated": "2026-09-03T09:54:24.058Z", "__OculusDBType": "Application", "group": 0, "binaryType": 1, "hmd": 2, "__sn": "OculusDB-Official", "blocked": false, "appName": "Ride Anywhere", "baseline_offer": null, "priceFormatted": "0.-01", "priceOffsetNumerical": -1, "priceLimboDetected": false, "appHasDiscount": false, "discountEndTime": "0001-01-01T00:00:00", "appHasTrial": false, "appCanBeBought": false, "currency": "", "canonicalName": "dreamtree-lab-llc-ride-anywhere-android6d0f-iivff", "current_gift_offer": null, "current_offer": null, "current_trial_offer": null, "displayName": "Ride Anywhere", "display_name": "Ride Anywhere", "display_long_description": "Tired of staring at the wall while you clock miles on your exercise bike? \n\nWould you rather ride through the streets of your favorite city?\n\nRide Anywhere will teleport you to cities around the world while you ride.\n\nHow it works: Jump on your exercise bike, open the app and use hand tracking to select a city. That's it: You're transported from your home to the city of your choice.\n\nVR is the only platform that makes you feel like you are really there- and our 360 videos made to be played while riding an exercise bike enhance that feeling.\n\nDon't let controllers get in the way of your grip. Ride Anywhere is built from the ground up for Hand Tracking. Navigate menus, select your destination, and control playback using simple gestures, allowing you to keep your hands exactly where they belong: on your handlebars.\n\nBeing able to cycle in fun new places every day makes exercise feel easier and more enjoyable. You'll look forward to every session!\n\n", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "Tired of staring at the wall while you clock miles on your exercise bike? \n\nWould you rather ride through the streets of your favorite city?\n\nRide Anywhere will teleport you to cities around the world while you ride.\n\nHow it works: Jump on your exercise bike, open the app and use hand tracking to sele